      "name": "Wavetable growl bass",
      "how": "Engine 1 Wavetable on a vocal or growl table, LFO 1 synced 1/8 on Position (40–60%). Engine 2 a sine an octave down for weight. Filter 1 a formant or comb type, LFO 2 on its cutoff. Mono, glide 40 ms. Bus A: Distortion, then a compressor."
