      "name": "Supersaw",
      "how": "Osc A saw, Unison 7–9, detune a quarter of the way up, Blend 70–80%; Osc B the same an octave up, quieter. Filter off or low-pass at 8–10 kHz. Env 1 Attack 5–10 ms, Release 300–500 ms. Hyper/Dimension 25–35%, Reverb 15–20%."
    },
