      "name": "Pluck",
      "how": "One bright oscillator. Filter Low 24 at 200–400 Hz, Resonance 10–20%. Env 2 to cutoff, large amount: Attack 0, Decay 150–400 ms, Sustain -inf. Env 1 Decay 300–600 ms, Sustain -inf, Release 150–250 ms. Delay 1/8 dotted at 15–20%, Reverb 15%."
