      "name": "Sub bass",
      "how": "Sub sine alone (or Osc A on a sine) at 70–80%, mono. Env 1 Attack 1–3 ms, Release 30–80 ms. Random phase 0 on any oscillator used; no unison, no stereo FX."
    },
