      "name": "Evolving pad",
      "how": "Osc A and B on soft tables, Unison 4–6, low detune, a slow LFO (0.1–0.3 Hz) on WT Pos. Env 1 Attack 400–800 ms, Release 1.5–3 s. Low-pass at 2–4 kHz. Chorus 30%, Reverb 30–40%."
    }
